  <item>
    <title>All for 身心健康</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642d2c0d66e4c00c6a428266</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642d2c0d66e4c00c6a428266</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Apr 2023 08:06:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>咖啡哪有生活苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期为一场即兴聊天，主要是兔年伊始，绿大仙就遭受了工作任务的极大挑战（cui can），粒老师学业进入压力“平稳”阶段，同时也产生了对牛津教学方式的种种思辨，两个人一拍即合，不吐不快，别的放一边儿，今天，一切为了身心健康服务！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 屁滚尿流的学期结束，粒老师和同学们都在不同程度的suffer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 悟出来什么人真的适合牛津</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> 认知冲击的痛苦，远大于成绩本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 牛津如果是个人，ta绝不会为别人改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 差异化教学科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 什么是真正的导师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 绿大仙儿的苦，没有盼头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 人人都有执念——谁也别说谁了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> 身体倒下，屋漏偏逢连夜雨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3362">56:02</a> 降低标准，放过自己，降低标准，放过自己！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3749">1:02:29</a> 自己judge自己可还行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3924">1:05:24</a> 林子大了什么鸟儿都有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4269">1:11:09</a> 线上10个会，不如见面聊一句</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5050">1:24:10</a> 成年人的标志，就是清楚的知道自己在拿什么交换什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5095">1:24:55</a> 认识自己真的太难了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5260">1:27:40</a> 顺带发现一条自我执念的底层逻辑</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhPHC3zTpH5L5M3pYwQsEOu6L6v7.m4a" length="134741285" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:15</itunes:duration>
